<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Typing</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">樊宇镈(Coulson Fan)</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Typing</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4QCPqYa1MTWL6iqvWpo2h7</ttm:item><itunes:duration>04:03.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.331" end="00:14.380">You used to text like fireworks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.380" end="00:18.697">Now I’m watching your dot just blink</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.697" end="00:20.482">Three bubbles, then nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.482" end="00:25.046">Guess I’m back to guessing what you think</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.046" end="00:26.744">You said you’re not into games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.744" end="00:31.192">Just “bad at phones” or “lost in thought”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.192" end="00:33.001">But your last online was midnight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.001" end="00:37.032">And my name just fell off your plot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.032" end="00:40.073">You move like gravity</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.073" end="00:44.048">Then float off like air</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.048" end="00:46.365">Said “you’re different”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.365" end="00:49.258">I just didn’t know where</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.258" end="00:53.558">Now I’m stuck on “typing…”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.558" end="00:56.741">Like I’m the one who begged</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.741" end="00:59.533">Wasn’t it you who leaned in first</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.533" end="01:02.976">And said I made you feel safe?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.976" end="01:06.148">I don’t chase slow replies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.148" end="01:09.687">They don’t taste like care</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.687" end="01:12.058">You turned “good morning” into</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.058" end="01:16.014">A message I don’t dare</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.014" end="01:17.616">You liked every post I made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.616" end="01:22.339">Except the one that asked “be honest”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.339" end="01:23.954">Funny how you read me daily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.954" end="01:28.754">But your heart’s still set to “cautious”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.754" end="01:30.415">You kissed like it meant the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.415" end="01:35.109">Then vanished like a test run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.109" end="01:36.946">What’s with these soulmates</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.946" end="01:40.746">That time out after the fun?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.746" end="01:42.683">I’ve seen this plot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.683" end="01:47.175">Flash start, ghost end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.175" end="01:49.857">You say “it’s not you”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.857" end="01:52.837">I say “cool, it depends”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.837" end="01:57.252">Now I’m stuck on “typing…”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.252" end="02:00.417">But no words ever land</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.417" end="02:02.235">You built a bridge with fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.235" end="02:06.924">Then left me holding sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.924" end="02:10.074">You said “don’t overthink it”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.074" end="02:13.198">But I read between the lines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.198" end="02:14.993">Even silence has a meaning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.993" end="02:19.434">And yours sounds a lot like “goodbye”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.434" end="02:22.237">They love the chase But not the arrival</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.237" end="02:25.476">They love the echo But not the reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.476" end="02:28.569">They say “I felt it”But never “I stayed”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.569" end="02:31.514">They want your attention But not the weight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.514" end="02:34.859">They flirt like fire Then vanish like breath</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.859" end="02:38.008">They crave your softness But fear what’s left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.008" end="02:41.227">They want deep souls Just not the depth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.227" end="02:44.046">Say “don’t get attached” Then beg for respect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.046" end="02:48.153">Now I’m stuck on “typing…”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.153" end="02:51.189">While you post quotes ‘bout space</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.189" end="02:53.410">You wrote poems in my DMs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.410" end="02:57.708">Then erased your trace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.708" end="03:01.525">I won’t beg for context</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.525" end="03:04.196">Or decode delay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.196" end="03:05.696">Just remember</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.045" end="03:06.545">You paused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.427" end="03:09.621">And I walked away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.621" end="03:15.879">I won't reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.879" end="03:22.233">I won't reply (Typing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.233" end="03:28.702">I won't reply (Nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.702" end="03:34.918">I won't reply (Typing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.918" end="03:41.296">I won't replay (Typing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.296" end="03:47.594">I won't replay (Typing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:47.594" end="03:54.206">I won't replay (Nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:54.206" end="04:00.196">I won't replay (Nothing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.196" end="04:01.696">I won't replay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.331" end="00:14.380">我们曾经相谈甚欢感觉相见恨晚</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.380" end="00:18.697">每一条语音都像是心跳同步</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.697" end="00:20.482">可有时候你却冰冷的像人机</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.482" end="00:25.046">让我猜不透你到底在想什么</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.046" end="00:26.744">你说你很真诚</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.744" end="00:31.192">只是你有时太忙 或者手机总静音</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.192" end="00:33.001">可我明明看见你的在线记录</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.001" end="00:37.032">是你的真的忘了我？还是“真诚”是谎言</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.032" end="00:40.073">你来时的热情让我以为是命中注定</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.073" end="00:44.048">可忽冷忽热的感觉让我陷入怀疑</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.048" end="00:46.365">你说着一些”你很不一样“这样的话语</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.365" end="00:49.258">听起来我好像挺特别 但这些都只是表面而已</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.258" end="00:53.558">我困在你那个“输入中...”的画面</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.558" end="00:56.741">好像是我在乞求回应</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.741" end="00:59.533">但明明是你先靠近</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.533" end="01:02.976">曾经的热情难道都是在演戏</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.976" end="01:06.148">我受够了你的轮回消息若即若离</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.148" end="01:09.687">那不是给个人空间 只是你在钓鱼</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.687" end="01:12.058">你把“早安宝贝”变成了一种工具</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.058" end="01:16.014">看似甜蜜 时则是你的把戏</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.014" end="01:17.616">你几乎赞过我发的所有生活</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.616" end="01:22.339">除了那次我问：“我们是什么关系？”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.339" end="01:23.954">你总说你在看、在思考</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.954" end="01:28.754">可你连一个真正的关心都从未做到</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.754" end="01:30.415">见面的时候你吻得无比甜蜜</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.415" end="01:35.109">我甚至一度以为这是对的开始</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.109" end="01:36.946">可分开后你冷漠的让我感到可笑</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.946" end="01:40.746">什么灵魂伴侣 都是话术而已</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.746" end="01:42.683">看多了太多相似的剧本</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.683" end="01:47.175">开始很热烈 结束很安静</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.175" end="01:49.857">你曾说你也很感性专一</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.857" end="01:52.837">我说可能吧 因为日久才见人心</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.837" end="01:57.252">我困在了你“输入中”的画面里</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.252" end="02:00.417">但你却从不在我期待的时候出现</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.417" end="02:02.235">每当我要释怀准备放弃时</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.235" end="02:06.924">偏偏你又热情回复好像一切如常</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.924" end="02:10.074">你总说是我想的太多</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.074" end="02:13.198">可我不傻早就明白了一切</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.198" end="02:14.993">若即若离忽冷忽热的关系</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.993" end="02:19.434">早就已经是答案 所以我彻底看清了这群人</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.434" end="02:22.237">他们喜欢追逐 却不喜欢稳定</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.237" end="02:25.476">他们喜欢调情 却怕听到回应</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.476" end="02:28.569">他们说“我对你有感觉”却从不说“我喜欢你”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.569" end="02:31.514">他们要你注意他们 却不要你真的靠近</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.514" end="02:34.859">他们热情时像火焰 但维持不久就会消失</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.859" end="02:38.008">他们渴望你的温柔 却害怕你和他绑定</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.008" end="02:41.227">他们说他们想要深度关系 但他们从不想认真对待关系</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.227" end="02:44.046">他们说“我们需要空间”转头又说：“你情绪不稳定”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.046" end="02:48.153">我受够了困在你的世界里</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.153" end="02:51.189">因为你不配再让我产生情绪</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.189" end="02:53.410">我删掉了你所有的信息</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.410" end="02:57.708">就全当是命运给我的课题</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.708" end="03:01.525">我不再追问原因</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.525" end="03:04.196">也不再需要你的解释</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.196" end="03:05.696">只希望你记住</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.045" end="03:06.545">真诚不是把戏</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.427" end="03:09.621">而我看清了你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.621" end="03:15.879">就不会再受困于你</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.879" end="03:22.233">我不会再回你的消息</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.233" end="03:28.702">我不会再回你的消息</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.702" end="03:34.918">我不会再回你的消息</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.918" end="03:41.296">我不会再重蹈覆辙</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.296" end="03:47.594">我不会再重蹈覆辙</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:47.594" end="03:54.206">我不会再重蹈覆辙</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:54.206" end="04:00.196">我不会再重蹈覆辙</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.196" end="04:04.196">我不会再重蹈覆辙</p></div></body></tt>